<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S0.F1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 1</span>: </span><span id="S0.F1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Examples of synthetically generated documents across diverse domains and tasks. Our framework produces documents with realistic layouts, VLM-generated content, diffusion-based handwriting, and contextual visual elements.</span></figcaption>
