<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S4.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="S4.T2.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Layout-FID (LFID) <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">21</a>]</cite> and performance comparison for <math id="S4.T2.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{CC}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝖢𝖢</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{CC}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="S4.T2.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathsf{IC}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝖨𝖢</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathsf{IC}</annotation></semantics></math> sampling across different <math id="S4.T2.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math> values on LayoutLMv3 (VQA, KIE, CLS) and Faster R-CNN (DLA). Results averaged over 5 seeds (std <math id="S4.T2.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&lt;0.04" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.04</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&lt;0.04</annotation></semantics></math>).</span></figcaption>
</figure>
