<section id="Pt0.A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix 0.A </span>Claude vs. Gemma 3 27B Comparison</h2>

<div id="Pt0.A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To improve reproducibility we’ve done formal evaluation with Gemma 3 27B (<a href="#Pt0.A1.T5" title="In Appendix 0.A Claude vs. Gemma 3 27B Comparison ‣ DocDjinn: Controllable Synthetic Document Generation with VLMs and Handwriting Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tab.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>), which shows significantly lower pipeline success but comparable visual quality when successful—reflecting instruction-following limitations in current open-source VLMs, not framework constraints.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Pt0.A1.T5" class="ltx_table">
<div id="Pt0.A1.T5.3" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:109.4pt;vertical-align:-52.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-21.1pt,6.7pt) scale(0.891100019374892,0.891100019374892) ;">
