<ul id="Pt0.A2.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="Pt0.A2.I1.ix1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">*</span> 
<div id="Pt0.A2.I1.ix1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A2.I1.ix1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For these datasets, we use a subset of the original training splits.</p>
</div></li>
