<section id="Pt0.A9" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix 0.I </span>Synthetic Dataset Samples</h2>

<div id="Pt0.A9.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A9.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section provides visual examples from all synthetic datasets specified in Section <a href="#Pt0.A8" title="Appendix 0.H Synthetic Dataset Definitions ‣ DocDjinn: Controllable Synthetic Document Generation with VLMs and Handwriting Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">0.H</span></a>. For each dataset, we display representative synthetic documents generated by the VLM-based synthesis pipeline in <a href="#Pt0.A9.F11" title="In Appendix 0.I Synthetic Dataset Samples ‣ DocDjinn: Controllable Synthetic Document Generation with VLMs and Handwriting Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figs.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">11</span></a>, <a href="#Pt0.A9.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ Appendix 0.I Synthetic Dataset Samples ‣ DocDjinn: Controllable Synthetic Document Generation with VLMs and Handwriting Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>, <a href="#Pt0.A9.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ Appendix 0.I Synthetic Dataset Samples ‣ DocDjinn: Controllable Synthetic Document Generation with VLMs and Handwriting Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>, <a href="#Pt0.A9.F14" title="Figure 14 ‣ Appendix 0.I Synthetic Dataset Samples ‣ DocDjinn: Controllable Synthetic Document Generation with VLMs and Handwriting Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a>, <a href="#Pt0.A9.F15" title="Figure 15 ‣ Appendix 0.I Synthetic Dataset Samples ‣ DocDjinn: Controllable Synthetic Document Generation with VLMs and Handwriting Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">15</span></a>, <a href="#Pt0.A9.F16" title="Figure 16 ‣ Appendix 0.I Synthetic Dataset Samples ‣ DocDjinn: Controllable Synthetic Document Generation with VLMs and Handwriting Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">16</span></a>, <a href="#Pt0.A9.F17" title="Figure 17 ‣ Appendix 0.I Synthetic Dataset Samples ‣ DocDjinn: Controllable Synthetic Document Generation with VLMs and Handwriting Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">17</span></a>, <a href="#Pt0.A9.F18" title="Figure 18 ‣ Appendix 0.I Synthetic Dataset Samples ‣ DocDjinn: Controllable Synthetic Document Generation with VLMs and Handwriting Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a>, <a href="#Pt0.A9.F19" title="Figure 19 ‣ Appendix 0.I Synthetic Dataset Samples ‣ DocDjinn: Controllable Synthetic Document Generation with VLMs and Handwriting Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">19</span></a>, <a href="#Pt0.A9.F20" title="Figure 20 ‣ Appendix 0.I Synthetic Dataset Samples ‣ DocDjinn: Controllable Synthetic Document Generation with VLMs and Handwriting Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">20</span></a>, <a href="#Pt0.A9.F21" title="Figure 21 ‣ Appendix 0.I Synthetic Dataset Samples ‣ DocDjinn: Controllable Synthetic Document Generation with VLMs and Handwriting Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">21</span></a> and <a href="#Pt0.A9.F22" title="Figure 22 ‣ Appendix 0.I Synthetic Dataset Samples ‣ DocDjinn: Controllable Synthetic Document Generation with VLMs and Handwriting Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">22</span></a>. The examples demonstrate the variety in layout, typography, and content while maintaining task-specific authenticity.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Pt0.A9.F11" class="ltx_figure">
