<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="Pt0.A11.F23.sf3.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(c)</span> </span><span id="Pt0.A11.F23.sf3.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">WTQ <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib42" title="" class="ltx_ref">43</a>]</cite> question embeddings for real and synthetic data overlaid.</span></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2">
