<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="Pt0.A11.F24.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 24</span>: </span><span id="Pt0.A11.F24.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Comparisons of class distributions between real and synthetic data for RVL-CDIP <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib22" title="" class="ltx_ref">22</a>]</cite> (a), Tobacco3482 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib33" title="" class="ltx_ref">34</a>]</cite> (b) and DocLayNet-CLS <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib43" title="" class="ltx_ref">44</a>]</cite> (c).</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="Pt0.A11.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">0.K.3 </span>KIE</h3>

<div id="Pt0.A11.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="Pt0.A11.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#Pt0.A11.F25" title="In 0.K.3 KIE ‣ Appendix 0.K Synthetic Ground Truth ‣ DocDjinn: Controllable Synthetic Document Generation with VLMs and Handwriting Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figs.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">25</span></a> and <a href="#Pt0.A11.F26" title="Figure 26 ‣ 0.K.3 KIE ‣ Appendix 0.K Synthetic Ground Truth ‣ DocDjinn: Controllable Synthetic Document Generation with VLMs and Handwriting Diffusion" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">26</span></a> show spatial heatmaps comparing entity placement by type between real and synthetic data for CORD <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib41" title="" class="ltx_ref">42</a>]</cite>, FUNSD <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib29" title="" class="ltx_ref">30</a>]</cite> and SROIE <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib28" title="" class="ltx_ref">29</a>]</cite>. The heatmaps demonstrate that spatial distributions of key-value entities are well-preserved, validating the quality of element-level annotations generated by our micro template without access to real annotations.</p>
</div>
<figure id="Pt0.A11.F25" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.21824v1/cord_alpha=1.0_spatial_heatmaps.png" id="Pt0.A11.F25.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:476/632;" width="476" height="632" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="Pt0.A11.F25.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 25</span>: </span><span id="Pt0.A11.F25.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Heatmaps comparing entity placement by type between real and synthetic for CORD <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib41" title="" class="ltx_ref">42</a>]</cite>.
</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="Pt0.A11.F26" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
